10. Java Test Harness

The existing Java migration tool should be extended into the common test orchestrator.

Conceptually:

Test Specification
       |
       v
Java Test Harness
       |
       +--> Prepare test data
       |
       +--> Simulate external events
       |
       +--> Execute Pentaho baseline
       |
       +--> Execute Hop workload
       |
       +--> Capture evidence
       |
       +--> Evaluate assertions
       |
       +--> Semantic comparison
       |
       +--> Generate HTML
       |
       +--> Generate JUnit XML
       |
       +--> Return exit code

External-system adapters must remain thin.

Examples:

SFTP adapter:
send(file, destination)

File adapter:
copy(file, destination)

MQ adapter:
publish(message)

HTTP adapter:
send(request)

Do not put business logic into these adapters.

